                    ["If the only Pikemen I had ever had the pleasure of encountering were thou and Argus, I would say differently. But many of the Pikemen I have seen are vain braggarts who delight in bullying anyone weaker than they are." *"And their idea of honor is bought cheaply in ransom and \@tolls\@ on the travellers they are sworn to protect! I'm sorry, <v1>, but I think the Pikemen are, on the whole, contemptible!"];
